    <briefdescription>
<para>List model with one stable row per inspected series. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provided by <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PlotInspector_1a0bfc971d317ca5e10284c4345b03d147" kindref="member">PlotInspector::model</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1SelectionTool_1a5137b8c4cf816f58dd7582b83c5217f0" kindref="member">SelectionTool::model</ref></computeroutput>. Rows are added and removed only when the set of inspected series changes; cursor movement updates rows in place, so delegates are reused.</para>
